","date":"2026-10-28"}],"media":[{"who":"Laura Ingraham","what":"Called DSA member Angie Nixon's Democratic Senate primary win the best midterm news for the GOP since Platner.","when":"2026-08-20","lean":"R"},{"who":"Charlamagne tha God","what":"Gave Laura Loomer Donkey of the Day on The Breakfast Club over her attacks on Democratic Senate nominee Angie Nixon.","when":"2026-08-31","lean":"other"},{"who":"Nathan Gonzales","what":"Inside Elections moved the Florida Senate race for Ashley Moody's seat from Solid Republican to Likely Republican.","when":"2026-10-20","lean":"nonpartisan"}],"donorSignal":{"z":0.283,"parts":{"instate":0.309,"breadth":0.256},"shift_logit":0.0,"applies":false},"research":{"summary":"Appointed Republican Sen. Ashley Moody faces Democratic state Rep. Angie Nixon of Jacksonville in the special election for the rest of Marco Rubio's term, with a Stetson poll showing Moody holding a double digit lead in a state where Republicans have about 1.5 million more registered voters. Moody casts Nixon as a socialist who is soft on crime, while Nixon, who outraised Moody last quarter, attacks Moody over the Hope Florida settlement and health care cuts.","issues":[{"issue":"Hope Florida settlement","why":"Democrats say Moody's office approved a Medicaid settlement that routed 10 million dollars to political committees, while Moody has not been charged and denies wrongdoing.","src":"https://www.wusf.org/politics-issues/2026-10-01/democrats-slam-ashley-moody-amid-heated-us-senate-race"},{"issue":"Crime and policing","why":"Moody runs on her record as a judge and attorney general and says Nixon quotes cop killers, which Nixon disputes.","src":"https://floridianpress.com/2026/10/ashley-moody-puts-tough-on-crime-resume-against-angie-nixons-radical-approach/"},{"issue":"Socialism label","why":"Nixon joined the Democratic Socialists of America in June but calls herself a capitalist who supports regulation, while Moody frames the race as freedom versus socialism.",