idianpress.com/2026/10/ashley-moody-puts-tough-on-crime-resume-against-angie-nixons-radical-approach/"},{"title":"Democrats hit Moody on Hope Florida and access","date":"2026-10-01","what":"Florida Democrats accused Moody of dodging reporters and town halls and revived the Hope Florida controversy. Moody declined to debate Nixon, calling her a self proclaimed socialist.","helps":"D","kind":"scandal","src":"https://www.wusf.org/politics-issues/2026-10-01/democrats-slam-ashley-moody-amid-heated-us-senate-race"},{"title":"Moody ad labels Nixon a socialist","date":"2026-09-28","what":"Moody's ad shows Nixon discussing joining the DSA and frames the race as freedom versus socialism.","helps":"R","kind":"ad","src":"https://floridianpress.com/2026/09/ashley-moody-releases-ad-attacking-angie-nixon-as-a-socialist-ties-to-dsa/"},{"title":"Trump endorses Moody","date":"2026-09-18","what":"Trump released a video fully endorsing Moody, crediting her tax cut and border votes, and called Nixon a communist.","helps":"R","kind":"endorsement","src":"https://flvoicenews.com/trump-send-ashley-moody-back-to-the-senate-defeat-communist-angie-nixon/"}],"events":[{"title":"The socialist label","prompt":"Attack ads hammer one candidate's membership in the Democratic Socialists of America. Reporters ask whether the label fits.","issue":"other","src":"https://floridianpress.com/2026/09/ashley-moody-releases-ad-attacking-angie-nixon-as-a-socialist-ties-to-dsa/","opts":[{"label":"Own the left lane","say":"Embrace a progressive agenda on wages, housing and health care.","pos":-0.9,"trump":-0.8,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Capitalist who regulates","say":"Say you believe in markets with rules and focus on costs.","pos":-0.2,"trump":-0.3,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Freedom versus socialism","say":"Frame the race as a choice between freedom and socialism.","pos":0.9,"trump":0.8,"tone":"fiery"}]},{"title":"Hope Florida questions","prompt":"A 10 million dollar Medicaid settlement routed to political commit